le for ticket refunds.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:115:    /// @notice Emitted when the winning ticket is proven and all terminal quote-token liabilities are allocated.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:131:    /// @notice Emitted when the winning ticket owner burns the ticket and receives the corresponding prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:132:    /// @param ticketId Burned winning ticket ID.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:147:    /// @notice Emitted when an owner burns one or more tickets for a full quote-token refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:148:    /// @param owner Ticket owner that burned the tickets and received the refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:151:    /// @param amount Raw six-decimal quote-token units refunded, equal to `entryQuantity * ENTRY_PRICE`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:152:    /// @param remainingRefundLiability Raw six-decimal quote-token units still claimable after this refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:173:    /// @notice Emitted when the escrowed prize is returned after a cash result or refund transition.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:220:    /// @notice Raised when a refund batch is empty or exceeds the bounded ticket limit.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:222:    /// @param maximum Maximum ticket IDs accepted per refund transaction.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:242:    /// @notice Raised when refunds are requested before the applicable liveness deadline.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:243:    /// @param deadline Unix timestamp, in seconds, at which refunds become available.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:253:    /// @param recipient Draw requester that was due the refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:284:    /// @notice Raised when redemption supplies a ticket other than the recorded winning