{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"reent|approval|operator|callback|transferable|bearer|receiver|recipient|threat|safeMint|safe mint\\\" DESIGN.md WORKSPACE.md packages/contracts/src -g '*.md' -g '*.sol'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"reent|approval|operator|callback|transferable|bearer|receiver|recipient|threat|safeMint|safe mint\\\" DESIGN.md WORKSPACE.md packages/contracts/src -g '*.md' -g '*.sol'\"","aggregated_output":"DESIGN.md:2:Ethereum NFT raffle; immutable factory, ERC-1167 clones with immutable implementation. One entry costs 1,000,000 units of canonical six-decimal USDC. One purchase mints a transferable ERC721 ticket representing a contiguous inclusive range. Exactly one ERC721 prize is escrowed atomically at creation. Reserve met awards NFT and 95% sponsor / 5% treasury. Reserve missed awards 80% gross to winner, 15% sponsor, 5% treasury. Refund outcome pays 100% per entry and returns prize. Rounding is floor on aggregate protocol fee; remainder must be allocated without loss. No administrator, mutable configuration or upgrade. Request window [sale end, end+2days); callback accepted strictly before request timestamp+2days. Refunds open at deadline. Callback records result only. Settlement is permissionless, storage-only; redemption requires current ticket owner, burns claim atomically, and must revert all effects on delivery failure. Sponsor and treasury can claim independently after settlement. Never move assets between raffle clones. Quote token and Chainlink wrapper are trusted canonical dependencies; arbitrary prize contracts and ticket recipients are untrusted. Frontend discovery is advisory; transaction decisions must reread current chain state.\npackages/contracts/src/libraries/RaffleConstants.sol:35:    /// @notice Duration after an accepted request during which its authenticated callback may resolve, in seconds.\npackages/contracts/src/libraries/RaffleConstants.sol:38:    /// @notice Gas-unit limit requested for the single-word Chainlink callback.\npackages/contracts/src/libraries/RaffleConstants.sol:41:    /// @notice Block confirmations requested from Chainlink before callback fulfillment.\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:25:    uint32 public constant override callbackGasLimit = RaffleConstants.VRF_CALLBACK_GAS_LIMIT;\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:64:    /// @param protocolTreasury_ Immutable protocol-fee recipient used by every raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:108:        // slither-disable-next-line reentrancy-no-eth\npackages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:152:    /// @dev Validates the sponsor-selected token, recipient, reserve, and supported ERC-721 interface before cloning.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:10:/// @notice Defines one autonomous NFT raffle using fixed-price USDC entries and one transferable ERC-721 ticket per\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:12:/// @dev Ticket IDs are sequential. Each ticket stores one inclusive uint128 entry range and remains a transferable\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:13:///      bearer claim until its owner atomically burns it for redemption or refund. The immutable quote token is trusted\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:26:        /// @notice A Chainlink VRF request was accepted and its callback window is open.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:38:    /// @param sponsorRecipient Immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and any returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:39:    /// @param protocolTreasury Immutable recipient of protocol fees.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:66:    /// @param recipient Address that received the newly minted ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:74:        address indexed recipient,\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:88:    /// @param callbackDeadline Exclusive Unix-timestamp deadline for accepting the authenticated callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:95:        uint256 callbackDeadline\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:98:    /// @notice Emitted when an authenticated, ABI-decodable callback cannot resolve the raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:99:    /// @param receivedRequestId Request ID supplied by the wrapper callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:101:    /// @param status Current raffle status when the callback is ignored.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:104:    /// @notice Emitted when an authenticated callback selects the winning entry and final result.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:121:    /// @param sponsorAmount Raw six-decimal quote-token units allocated to the sponsor recipient as the remainder.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:161:    /// @notice Emitted when the complete current sponsor balance is released to its immutable recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:163:    /// @param recipient Immutable sponsor recipient that received the payment.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:165:    event SponsorProceedsReleased(address indexed caller, address indexed recipient, uint256 amount);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:175:    /// @param recipient Immutable sponsor recipient that received the prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:179:        address indexed caller, address indexed recipient, address indexed prizeToken, uint256 prizeTokenId\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:197:    /// @notice Raised when an ERC-721 receiver callback does not exactly match the configured factory prize deposit.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:198:    /// @param token ERC-721 contract that invoked the receiver callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:199:    /// @param tokenId Token ID supplied by the callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:201:    /// @param operator Address identified as the transfer operator.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:202:    error UnexpectedPrize(address token, uint256 tokenId, address from, address operator);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:226:    /// @param destination Rejected payout recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:253:    /// @param recipient Draw requester that was due the refund.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:255:    error NativeRefundFailed(address recipient, uint256 amount);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:300:    /// @param recipient Address that should own the prize after delivery.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:301:    error PrizeDeliveryVerificationFailed(address recipient);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:311:    /// @param recipient Address that receives the newly minted ERC-721 range ticket.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:314:    function buyEntries(address recipient, uint128 entryCount) external returns (uint256 ticketId);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:322:    /// @notice Enables full refunds after the sold-raffle request deadline or an accepted request's callback deadline.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:327:    /// @dev Anyone may execute; ownership is not read, the ticket remains transferable, and no external asset transfer\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:346:    /// @notice Releases the complete current sponsor-proceeds balance to the immutable sponsor recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:354:    /// @notice Returns the escrowed prize to the immutable sponsor recipient after `CashWon` or `Refunding`.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:359:    /// @notice Returns the wrapper's current native direct-funding price for the configured callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:365:    /// @return fee Estimated native-token wei for the configured callback and one random word.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:379:    /// @notice Returns the exclusive deadline for accepting the authenticated callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:381:    function callbackDeadline() external view returns (uint256 deadline);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:398:    /// @notice Returns the fixed Chainlink callback execution limit.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:400:    function callbackGasLimit() external view returns (uint32 gasLimit);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:403:    /// @return confirmations Blocks requested before callback fulfillment.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:414:    /// @notice Returns the immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and returned prizes.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:415:    /// @return recipient Sponsor recipient address.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:416:    function sponsorRecipient() external view returns (address recipient);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:418:    /// @notice Returns the immutable recipient of this raffle's protocol fees.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:467:    /// @return recipient Winner at redemption time, or the zero address before redemption.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:468:    function winnerRecipient() external view returns (address recipient);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:475:    /// @return amount Raw six-decimal quote-token units claimable by the immutable sponsor recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:490:    /// @notice Returns when an authenticated callback resolved the raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:514:    /// @notice Returns whether the prize has been delivered to the winner or returned to the sponsor recipient.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:15:    /// @param sponsorRecipient Immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and any returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:34:    /// @param sponsorRecipient Immutable recipient of sponsor quote proceeds and any returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:38:    /// @param protocolTreasury Immutable recipient of protocol fees.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:89:    /// @notice Raised when a configured token or recipient is known protocol plumbing.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:102:    /// @param params Sponsor-selected recipient, prize, reserve, and timing configuration.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:116:    /// @notice Returns the immutable recipient of protocol fees from every raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:120:    /// @notice Returns the fixed Chainlink callback execution limit used by every raffle.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:122:    function callbackGasLimit() external view returns (uint32 gasLimit);\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffleFactory.sol:125:    /// @return confirmations Blocks requested before callback fulfillment.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:21:/// @notice Escrows one NFT and sells fixed-price USDC entries through one transferable ERC-721 ticket per purchase.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:23:///      callbacks, and winner proofs are O(1) in entry count. Tickets remain transferable bearer claims until their\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:47:    uint32 public constant override callbackGasLimit = RaffleConstants.VRF_CALLBACK_GAS_LIMIT;\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:141:    /// @dev True only while the wrapper request call is executing, so a synchronous callback cannot resolve early.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:209:    function buyEntries(address recipient, uint128 entryCount)\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:217:        if (recipient == address(0)) revert InvalidRecipient();\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:235:        _safeMint(recipient, ticketId);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:236:        emit TicketPurchased(msg.sender, recipient, ticketId, firstEntry, lastEntry, entryCount, grossAmount);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:257:        (requestId, paidPrice) = requestRandomnessPayInNative(callbackGasLimit, requestConfirmations, 1, extraArgs);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:272:        emit DrawRequested(requestId, msg.sender, paidPrice, excess, drawRequestedAt, callbackDeadline());\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:290:            deadline = callbackDeadline();\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:379:        address recipient = sponsorRecipient;\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:380:        _transferQuote(recipient, amount);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:381:        emit SponsorProceedsReleased(msg.sender, recipient, amount);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:402:        address recipient = sponsorRecipient;\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:404:        prizeToken.transferFrom(address(this), recipient, prizeTokenId);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:405:        if (prizeToken.ownerOf(prizeTokenId) != recipient) revert PrizeDeliveryVerificationFailed(recipient);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:406:        emit SponsorPrizeReleased(msg.sender, recipient, address(prizeToken), prizeTokenId);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:412:    /// @param operator ERC-721 transfer operator, which must be the canonical factory.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:415:    /// @return selector ERC-721 receiver acceptance selector.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:416:    function onERC721Received(address operator, address from, uint256 tokenId, bytes calldata)\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:423:                || from != sponsor || operator != factory\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:425:            revert UnexpectedPrize(msg.sender, tokenId, from, operator);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:437:        fee = i_vrfV2PlusWrapper.calculateRequestPriceNative(callbackGasLimit, 1);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:442:        fee = i_vrfV2PlusWrapper.estimateRequestPriceNative(callbackGasLimit, 1, requestGasPriceWei);\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:463:    function callbackDeadline() public view override returns (uint256 deadline) {\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:491:    /// @dev Tickets remain transferable bearer claims in every lifecycle state. Known protocol sinks are rejected\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:493:    /// @param to Prospective ticket recipient, or the zero address for a burn.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:495:    /// @param auth Caller whose owner or operator authority is checked by ERC-721.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:505:    ///      occurs. In-flight, late, wrong-request, duplicate, and ABI-decodable wrong-length callbacks are ignored for\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:507:    /// @param requestId Wrapper-authenticated request identifier supplied by the callback.\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:512:                || block.timestamp >= callbackDeadline()\npackages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:562:    /// @param to Immutable or owner-derived recipient of the claim.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
